                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "Rivet: The\nmeasured safe\nservice limit is\nFOUR. SIX is a\nbrief test",
                            "ceiling, not a\nnormal setting.\nEIGHT is a damage\nwarning. We set\nthe",
                            "regulator for\nservice, then\nverify the gauge.\nBigger is not a\nplan",
                            "just because it\nfits on a sign."
                          ],
