                              "id": "606c8c97-d238-4b63-a334-c5f6da3dbc49",
                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "Which launch plan\nserves every\nrequired stop\nwithout exceeding\nthe",
                                  "measured limit?\nThe choice of\nfuture emphasis\ndoes not add\npressure",
                                  "today. Slush\noffers to buy\nbrighter paint for\nthe arch instead.\nYou",
                                  "must decide\nwhether it can run\nnow, not whether\nit would\nphotograph",
                                  "well or whether\nsomeone can afford\nits construction."
                                ],
                                "avatarId": "",
